Oriel CEF patch 0006: CefRequestContext net log.

Adds StartNetLog, StopNetLog and IsNetLogging to CefRequestContext, with the
client callback CefNetLogCallback, as Electron's session.netLog
(shell/browser/api/electron_api_net_log.cc) does: the profile's network
context creates a network::mojom::NetLogExporter, the file is opened off the
UI thread, and the export starts with the content client's net log constants
in JSON. One export per profile, kept as profile user data. Failures carry
Electron's texts (net::ErrorToString, base::File::ErrorToString, "There is
already a net log running", "No net log in progress", "Failed to start net
log exporter"). API at CEF_NEXT (999998): API version 15400 and its hash are
unchanged.

Resolves: Oriel docs/DRIFT.md E42 (netLog).
Base: CEF a03e714 (branch 8037, CEF 154) with 0001-0005. Applies in chromium/src/cef.

